{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":491876,"name":"yuan fang","username":"yuan_fang","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/71c47a/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-15T14:19:10.424Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll Grok Bots on this account are unresponsive on both Mac desktop and mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBot “贴心小助理”: computer panel stuck on “连接中” (Connecting). Messages such as “有新邮件吗”, “Stop now”, “hello” get no reply.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBot “视觉群总监”: computer panel is visible, but every message still gets no reply.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSame on mobile.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTickets: T-F81493 (original), T-F81606 / T-F81712 (duplicates)\u003cbr\u003e\nConversation ID: c4791723-9dd0-4235-ae70-4ad4a3f16199\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease rebuild the Agent Computer. Keep bots, chats, files, logins, and routines intact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Mac.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSelect any bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend hello / Stop now / 有新邮件吗.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo reply. Panel is Connecting or visible but idle.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSame on mobile.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bot should reply, and the Agent Computer should connect instead of staying on Connecting / idle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-491876-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491876-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/b/8/b8f074c255ce2ae7fbda4735eb902fe2b2cbc069.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/qo31ORlNQid31Py59htm6lw9BC9.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"iShot_2026-09-15_20.02.00.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/8/b8f074c255ce2ae7fbda4735eb902fe2b2cbc069_2_690x494.jpeg\" alt=\"iShot_2026-09-15_20.02.00.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"qo31ORlNQid31Py59htm6lw9BC9\" width=\"690\" height=\"494\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/8/b8f074c255ce2ae7fbda4735eb902fe2b2cbc069_2_690x494.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/8/b8f074c255ce2ae7fbda4735eb902fe2b2cbc069_2_1035x741.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/8/b8f074c255ce2ae7fbda4735eb902fe2b2cbc069_2_1380x988.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"ECEBEB\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eiShot_2026-09-15_20.02.00.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2130×1526 185 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/d